      }
    ],
    "moment": [
      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "It was shown at the Salon of 1865 (where Monet exhibited for the first time) and became the scandal of the day. Again the painter was bombarded with invectives.",
        "source": {
          "author": "James Huneker",
          "title": "Promenades of an Impressionist: Manet",
